%% PakVoice AI — Sequence: Upload Document
sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant UI as Knowledge Base Page
  participant API as FastAPI /api/documents
  participant DocSvc as DocumentService
  participant Parser as File Parser
  participant Clean as Text Cleaner
  participant RAG as RAGService
  participant Emb as EmbeddingService
  participant OpenAI as OpenAI API
  participant Chroma as ChromaDB
  participant Meta as JSON Documents

  Client->>UI: Select PDF/DOCX/TXT/MD + title/category
  UI->>API: POST /api/documents/upload + JWT
  API->>DocSvc: process_upload(file, title, category, tags, user_id)

  DocSvc->>DocSvc: Validate type + size
  DocSvc->>DocSvc: Save file to uploads/
  DocSvc->>Parser: parse_uploaded_file(bytes)
  Parser-->>DocSvc: raw text
  DocSvc->>Clean: clean_text + chunk_text
  Clean-->>DocSvc: text chunks

  DocSvc->>RAG: index_document_chunks(doc_id, chunks, metadata)
  RAG->>Emb: embed_texts(chunks)
  Emb->>OpenAI: Embedding batch
  OpenAI-->>Emb: vectors
  Emb-->>RAG: embeddings
  RAG->>Chroma: add_documents(ids, embeddings, chunks)
  Chroma-->>RAG: ok
  RAG-->>DocSvc: indexed

  DocSvc->>Meta: save_document_metadata(...)
  Meta-->>DocSvc: saved
  DocSvc-->>API: DocumentUploadResponse
  API-->>UI: doc_id, chunks_created, status
  UI-->>Client: Document listed in KB
